# "Hexproof from black" and "a black permanent" are words of Knight of Grace's text (CR 612.2). Trait Doctoring
# replaces black with red in it until end of turn: the Knight now has hexproof from red, so Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# can't target it, and Bot2's Fatal Push (black) can; and it gets +1/+0 for a red permanent, Bot1's Dwarven Mauler
# (2/2 before the change, with no black permanent anywhere, 3/2 after).

